      "source": "Creates a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/PagedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>PagedModel</code></a> with an empt collection <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/core/EmbeddedWrapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server.core\"><code>EmbeddedWrapper</code></a> for the given domain type.",
