      "source": "Creates a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/PagedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>PagedModel</code></a> by converting the given <a href=\"../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> into a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/PagedModel.PageMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>PagedModel.PageMetadata</code></a> instance and\nusing the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/PagedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>PagedModel</code></a> to turn elements of the <a href=\"../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> into resources.",
